          "text": "为折扣率。仅统计状态为已完成、已发货、已退款的订单；已取消订单不计入。",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 7
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "title",
          "bbox": [
            62.7,
            268.3,
            137.7,
            283.3
          ],
          "text": "2 净销售额",
          "heading_level": 2,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 8
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "bbox": [
            83.7,
            297.7,
            272.7,
            308.2
          ],
          "text": "净销售额等于销售额扣除同期退款金额：",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 9
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "formula",
          "bbox": [
            272.9778137207031,
            318.19287109375,
            322.2978210449219,
            332.7728576660156
          ],
          "text": "S _ { n e t } = S - R",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "formula_latex": "S _ { n e t } = S - R",
          "reading_order": 10
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "bbox": [
            83.7,
            334.2,
            524.7,
            344.7
          ],
          "text": "其中 R 为统计期内的退款总额。注意：退款的统计期间以退款发生时间（refunded_at）计，不",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 11
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "bbox": [
            62.7,
            352.2,
            167.7,
            362.7
          ],
          "text": "以原订单下单时间计。",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 12
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "title",
          "bbox": [
            62.7,
            384.9,
            152.7,
            399.9
          ],
          "text": "3 同比增长率",
          "heading_level": 2,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 13
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "bbox": [
            83.7,
            414.2,
            262.2,
            424.7
          ],
          "text": "同比增长率用于比较本期与上年同期：",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 14
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "formula",
          "bbox": [
            259.6578063964844,
            434.77288818359375,
            335.6177978515625,
            452.952880859375
          ],
          "text": "g = \\frac{S_{t} - S_{t - 1}}{S_{t - 1}} \\times 100\\%",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "formula_latex": "g = \\frac{S_{t} - S_{t - 1}}{S_{t - 1}} \\times 100\\%",
          "reading_order": 15
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "bbox": [
            83.7,
            454.4,
            498.4,
            464.9
          ],
          "text": "示例：2025 年销售额约 214.4 万元，2024 年约 212.3 万元，则同比增长率约为 1.0%。",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 16
        },
        {
