          "block_type": "title",
          "bbox": [
            62.7,
            487.1,
            152.7,
            502.1
          ],
          "text": "4 折算与舍入",
          "heading_level": 2,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 17
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "bbox": [
            83.7,
            516.4,
            524.7,
            526.9
          ],
          "text": "金额以人民币元为单位存储，报表展示按四舍五入保留两位小数；万元口径保留一位小数。比率",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 18
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "bbox": [
            62.7,
            534.4,
            220.2,
            544.9
          ],
          "text": "类指标统一保留一位小数百分比。",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 19
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "title",
          "bbox": [
            62.7,
            567.1,
            137.7,
            582.1
          ],
          "text": "5 口径边界",
          "heading_level": 2,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 20
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "bbox": [
            83.7,
            596.4,
            524.7,
            606.9
          ],
          "text": "问数系统在用户未指明时间范围时，不得自行假设“去年”或“今年”，应主动向用户澄清；指",
          "heading_level": null,
          "table_cells": null,
          "ocr_confidence": null,
          "reading_order": 21
        },
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "block_type": "paragraph",
          "bbox": [
            62.7,
            614.4,
            430.2,
            624.9
          ],
          "text": "代“销售额”而语境涉及退款分析时，应确认用户意指毛销售额还是净销售额。",
